<title>SWITZERLAND: Clariant Q1 sales up 26 pct to 689 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Clariant Q1 sales up 26 pct to 689 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>MUTTENZ, Switzerland 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997 compared with first quarter 1996:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group sales		    689		 vs 548</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Clariant International AG. Clariant said the sales increase in Swiss franc terms amounted to 26 percent, but in local currencies it was 11 percent.  </p>
<p>Sales in sectors:</p>
<p> Textile dyes		   182		 vs 155</p>
<p> Textile chemicals	    104		 vs 82</p>
<p> Leather			  71		  vs 55</p>
<p> Paper			    97		  vs 75</p>
<p> Pigments/Additives	   78		  vs 65</p>
<p> Masterbatches		  132		 vs 91</p>
<p> Other			    25		  vs 25</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
